{% set pageLang = "de" %}
{% set pageTitle = "Pilotenflugbuch selbst hosten — Docker & PostgreSQL | NinerLog" %}
{% set pageDescription = "NinerLog auf dem eigenen Server betreiben: Docker Compose, fertige Images, PostgreSQL mit TLS und Sicherungen auf Speicher, der dir gehört. Open Source, kostenlos." %}
{% set pagePath = "/de/selbst-hosten" %}
{% set altEn = "/self-hosted" %}
{% set skipToContentLabel = "Zum Inhalt springen" %}
{% extends "layouts/base.njk" %}

{% block content %}

<!-- ============================================================
     HERO
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="relative bg-linear-to-br from-navy-900 via-navy-800 to-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-topo-pattern pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-4 reveal">
      <span class="freq-badge">
        <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-400 animate-blink"></span>
        DOCKER COMPOSE &bull; MIT &amp; AGPL-3.0
      </span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white text-balance reveal reveal-delay-1">
      Flugbuch selbst hosten
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal reveal-delay-2">
      Dieselbe Software, auf deiner eigenen Maschine. F&uuml;r alle, die ihre Flugdaten lieber im eigenen Haus behalten.
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-linear-to-r from-transparent via-sky-500/20 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     INSTALLATION
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-6 reveal">
      Vier Befehle.
    </h2>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg dark:prose-invert max-w-none reveal reveal-delay-1">
      <p>
        Das Deployment-Repository l&auml;dt fertige Images aus der GitHub Container Registry. Es muss nichts kompiliert werden und es ist keine Anmeldung n&ouml;tig:
      </p>
      <div class="not-prose rounded-lg border border-navy-700 dark:border-navy-600 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-2 bg-navy-800 border-b border-navy-700 dark:border-navy-600">
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-slate-400 tracking-wide">bash</span>
          <button type="button"
                  class="group copy-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors rounded-sm focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-sky-400"
                  data-copy="git clone https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized.git&#10;cd ninerlog-dockerized&#10;cp .env.example .env   # JWT_SECRET, REFRESH_SECRET, POSTGRES_PASSWORD setzen&#10;docker compose up -d"
                  data-copied-label="Kopiert"
                  aria-label="Befehle in die Zwischenablage kopieren">
            <svg class="copy-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 group-[.copied]:hidden" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"/></svg>
            <svg class="check-icon w-3.5 h-3.5 hidden group-[.copied]:block text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="copy-label">Kopieren</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <pre class="bg-navy-950 text-slate-300 text-sm p-4 overflow-x-auto"><code>git clone https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized.git
cd ninerlog-dockerized
cp .env.example .env   # JWT_SECRET, REFRESH_SECRET, POSTGRES_PASSWORD setzen
docker compose up -d</code></pre>
      </div>
      <p>
        Damit laufen die Go-API, das Frontend hinter nginx, PostgreSQL mit TLS, ein Certbot-Container f&uuml;r die Zertifikate und ein regelm&auml;&szlig;iger <code>pg_dump</code>-Job f&uuml;r die Sicherung.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 reveal reveal-delay-2">
      <h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Konfigurationsanleitungen</h3>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/CONFIGURATION.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          Konfigurationsreferenz (alle Variablen)
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/HTTPS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          HTTPS mit Let&rsquo;s Encrypt
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/BACKUPS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          Datenbank-Backups
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/CLOUD_BACKUPS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          Cloud-Backups pro Nutzer (S3, SFTP, WebDAV)
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/PASSKEYS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          Passkeys einrichten (WebAuthn)
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/MONITORING.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors">
          Monitoring mit Prometheus
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/blob/main/docs/UPGRADING.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-lg text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 hover:border-sky-500 dark:hover:border-sky-500 transition-colors sm:col-span-2">
          Auf neue Versionen aktualisieren
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"/><path d="M7 17 17 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
        Alle Anleitungen sind auf Englisch. <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized/tree/main/docs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-sky-500 hover:text-sky-400">Alle Deployment-Docs auf GitHub ansehen &rarr;</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     WAS DU BEKOMMST
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 lg:mb-16">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white reveal">
        Der volle Funktionsumfang.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto reveal reveal-delay-1">
        Die selbst gehostete Version ist derselbe Code wie der gehostete Dienst &mdash; ohne beschnittene Funktionen.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-1">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Alle Funktionen</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Flugerfahrungs&uuml;berwachung, Fluglehrer-Unterschrift, Import und Export, Auswertungen, Passkeys und Zwei-Faktor-Anmeldung. Nichts ist einer Cloud-Stufe vorbehalten.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Deine Datenbank</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">PostgreSQL mit versionierten Migrationen, auf deinem Host, mit TLS. Du kannst sie abfragen, sichern und jederzeit umziehen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-3">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Sicherungen bei dir</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Geplante Sicherungen auf jeden S3-kompatiblen Speicher, einen SFTP-Server oder eine WebDAV-Freigabe. Deine Zugangsdaten, deine Aufbewahrungsfristen.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-4">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Dokumentierte API</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Die REST-API bringt eine OpenAPI-Spezifikation mit. Was du auf deiner Instanz automatisieren willst, kannst du automatisieren.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-5">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Keine R&uuml;ckmeldung an uns</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Deine Instanz braucht uns nicht. Es gibt keinen Lizenzserver, bei dem sie sich melden m&uuml;sste.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="group p-6 bg-white dark:bg-navy-800 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-700 rounded-xl hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-200 reveal reveal-delay-6">
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-2">Lesbarer Quellcode</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">Go-API unter AGPL-3.0, Frontend und Deployment unter MIT. Pr&uuml;f es, bevor du deine Aufzeichnungen darauf legst.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     EHRLICHER HINWEIS
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-white dark:bg-navy-950 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="p-6 lg:p-8 bg-amber-500/5 border border-amber-500/30 rounded-xl reveal">
      <h2 class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-4">
        Solltest du wirklich selbst hosten?
      </h2>
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
        <p class="mb-0">
          Ehrliche Antwort: Als Einzelpilot meistens nicht. Du &uuml;bernimmst Erreichbarkeit, Zertifikate, PostgreSQL-Updates und Sicherungen f&uuml;r ein Nachweisdokument, das nicht an einer defekten Festplatte h&auml;ngen sollte &mdash; die <a href="https://app.ninerlog.com">gehostete Version</a> ist derselbe Code ohne diese Arbeit. Sinnvoll wird es mit einem Grund: ein <a href="/de/vereinsflugbuch">Verein</a>, der seine Daten auf eigener Infrastruktur will, oder eine Organisation mit Vorgaben zum Speicherort.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ============================================================
     CTA
     ============================================================ -->
<section class="bg-navy-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white mb-6 reveal">
      Auf den eigenen Server.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 reveal reveal-delay-1">
      Deployment-Repository, Konfigurationsreferenz und Hinweise zu Updates liegen auf GitHub.
    </p>
    <a href="https://github.com/fjaeckel/ninerlog-dockerized" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
       class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-8 py-4 bg-linear-to-r from-amber-400 to-amber-500 text-navy-900 font-semibold text-lg rounded-full shadow-lg shadow-amber-400/30 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-400/40 hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-hidden focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-400 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-navy-900 reveal reveal-delay-2">
      ninerlog-dockerized auf GitHub &rarr;
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
